@EcommerceApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@Token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN

### Health check (anónimo)
GET {{EcommerceApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Listar productos
GET {{EcommerceApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Obtener producto
GET {{EcommerceApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Crear producto
POST {{EcommerceApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

{
  "name": "Keyboard",
  "price": 49.99,
  "stock": 20
}

### Listar pedidos propios
GET {{EcommerceApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Crear pedido
POST {{EcommerceApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

{
  "productIds": [1, 2]
}

### Pedido inexistente
GET {{EcommerceApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders/999999
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
